response:
The report describes a cyberattack tracked as UAC-0142 targeting Ukrainian defense entities using spoofed messages about the DELTA situational awareness system. Phishing messages distributed a malicious ZIP archive leading to execution of RomCom malware, which subsequently dropped FateGrab and StealDeal infostealers.

